{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-3","name":"プロデューサー","text":"──凛世、お疲れ！\r\nよかったぞ！","trans":"──凛世，辛苦了！\n表现得很好！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6012003020010","name":"凛世","text":"────\r\nは、はい…………あの……","trans":"────\n是、是…………那个……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6012003020020","name":"凛世","text":"──皆さまの……お心に……\r\n届いたのでしょうか…………","trans":"──是否传达到了……\n大家……的心里呢…………","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6012003020030","name":"凛世","text":"プロデューサーさまは……────","trans":"制作人……────","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-11","name":"プロデューサー","text":"そんなの……もちろんだよ！　すごくいい出来だった！\r\nお客さんだって盛り上がってただろ？","trans":"那还用说……当然啦！　完成得非常棒！\n观众们不也很热烈吗？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-20","name":"プロデューサー","text":"（──っ\r\nいや……凛世はよくやってた……！）","trans":"（──唔\n不……凛世已经做得很好了……！）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-21","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……だから通過したんだぞ？","trans":"……所以才会通过啊？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6012003020050","name":"凛世","text":"────わからなく……なり……","trans":"────开始……不明白了……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6012003020060","name":"凛世","text":"……\r\n着替えて……まいります……──","trans":"……\n我去……换衣服了……──","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-26","name":"プロデューサー","text":"あっ、凛────","trans":"啊，凛────","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}